## Interface: 16001, 120105, 120107
## Title: ARL Extensions: Quality of Life
## Notes: Sleeping Bag reminders, Fishing Pole Alert, Spec Gear Swap, LFG Role Filter, Leveling BiS Spec and Auto Uprank.
## Author: aredpanda, andreg1
## Version: 0.1.0
## Group: ARLExtensions
## Dependencies: ARLExtensions
## OptionalDeps: ForeverLevelingBiS
## LoadOnDemand: 1
## X-ARLE-Pack: QoL
## X-ARLE-Group: QualityOfLife
## X-ARLE-Features: SleepingBag, FishingPoleAlert, SpecGearSwap, LFGRoleFilter, LevelingBiSSpec, AutoUprank
## X-ARLE-Feature-SleepingBag: title=Sleeping Bag; cmd=bag; default=off; replaces=ForeverSleepingBag
## X-ARLE-Feature-FishingPoleAlert: title=Fishing Pole Alert; cmd=fish; default=off; replaces=FishingPoleAlert
## X-ARLE-Feature-SpecGearSwap: title=Spec Gear Swap; cmd=gear; default=off; replaces=SpecGearSwap
## X-ARLE-Feature-LFGRoleFilter: title=LFG Role Filter; cmd=lfg; default=off; replaces=LFGRoleFilter
## X-ARLE-Feature-LevelingBiSSpec: title=Leveling BiS Spec; extends=ForeverLevelingBiS; group=ForeverLevelingBiS; cmd=spec; default=off; replaces=ForeverLevelingBiS_AutoSpec
## X-ARLE-Feature-AutoUprank: title=Auto Uprank; cmd=uprank; default=off

SleepingBag.lua
FishingPoleAlert.lua
SpecGearSwap.lua
LFGRoleFilter.lua
LevelingBiSSpec.lua
AutoUprank.lua
